WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:03.985
Unit twenty-two. Consent in Healthcare!

2
00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:09.242
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:12.368
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.418 --> 00:00:16.516
Today we learn about Consent in Healthcare. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:22.380
Informed consent. Say it with me. Informed consent!

6
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.640
Autonomy. Say it with me. Autonomy!

7
00:00:33.106 --> 00:00:37.189
Capacity. Say it with me. Capacity!

8
00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:45.587
Confidentiality. Say it with me. Confidentiality!

9
00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:53.032
Rights. Say it with me. Rights!

10
00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.843
Explanation. Say it with me. Explanation!

11
00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:08.440
Refusal. Say it with me. Refusal!

12
00:01:11.974 --> 00:01:15.941
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

13
00:01:19.425 --> 00:01:34.936
Informed consent means a patient understands the explanation of risks and benefits before agreeing. It respects autonomy and rights. Patients with capacity may refuse treatment, and confidentiality must be protected.

14
00:01:34.986 --> 00:01:38.600
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:39.778 --> 00:01:44.870
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.070
Capacity!

17
00:01:47.213 --> 00:01:52.570
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.770
Refusal!

19
00:01:54.935 --> 00:02:00.745
Did you know? Consent must be given freely — without pressure — to be valid!

20
00:02:00.795 --> 00:02:03.239
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:14.042
Think and answer. What information should a patient receive before a treatment?

22
00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:15.272
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.247 --> 00:02:21.408
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:24.208
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

